  "details": "I make personal avatars all the time and make content using them on social media, naturally people want what avatars I make but of course their made specifically for me only so I say no. BUT because of malicious clients and lack of security my avatars get ripped from my account either by vrchat data or ripped in game by a client and uploaded either publicly or used by someone that isn’t me. People put time, money and effort into their models just for someone to rip it off me for free. I’ve never played a game with THIS BAD of a problem with this, especially a game that’s social and really popular in certain communities with cosmetics you can buy for the game. Rippers and Leakers are the BIGGEST problem right now for creators not being able to go anywhere in the model they portray themselves as for the fear of being crashed, ripped or force reuploaded. I just want change. I want to use what I put my money, time and love into. \nSincerely a avatar/content creator.",
